  </p>

  <h2>4. Recipients and transfers</h2>
  <p>Data may be processed using technical services used by FaktumAI only as necessary to handle the enquiry.</p>
  <p>
    Any transfers of personal data outside the European Economic Area
    are carried out in accordance with applicable data protection law.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Data is retained only for as long as necessary to handle the enquiry or
    a potential customer relationship, or as required by law.
  </p>

